<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Art Deco Parrucchieri - Bari</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;1,300;1,400&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --gold: #c9a84c; --gold-lt: #e8d08a;
      --black: #0e0e0e; --dark: #141414; --mid: #1e1e1e;
      --light: #f5f0e8; --white: #ffffff; --gray: #888;
    }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { background: var(--black); color: var(--light); font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 300; overflow-x: hidden; }

    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 48px; height: 80px;
      background: rgba(14,14,14,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.2);
    }
    .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo img { height: 52px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 40px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--light); text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase;
      position: relative; transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .nav-links a::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -4px; left: 0;
      width: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); transition: width 0.3s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

    #home {
      min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      text-align: center; padding: 120px 24px 80px;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    #home::before, #home::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.07); border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    #home::before { width: 700px; height: 700px; animation-delay: 0s; }
    #home::after  { width: 1050px; height: 1050px; animation-delay: 2.5s; }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%,100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scale(1); }
      50%      { opacity: 0.7; transform: scale(1.03); }
    }

    .hero-logo-img {
      height: 260px; width: auto; max-width: 420px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(201,168,76,0.45), 0 0 160px rgba(201,168,76,0.18);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 32px rgba(201,168,76,0.5));
    }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 32px; animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.15s ease both;
    }
    .hero-divider {
      width: 60px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold);
      margin: 0 auto 32px; animation: fadeUp 1s 0.25s ease both;
    }

    .app-section {
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 28px;
      animation: fadeUp 1s 0.35s ease both; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }
    .qr-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gray);
    }
    .qr-wrapper {
      background: var(--white); padding: 14px; border-radius: 4px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(201,168,76,0.22);
    }
    .qr-wrapper img { display: block; width: 160px; height: 160px; image-rendering: pixelated; }
    .store-badges { display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    .badge {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.4); border-radius: 2px;
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--white);
      background: rgba(201,168,76,0.05); transition: all 0.3s;
    }
    .badge:hover { background: rgba(201,168,76,0.15); border-color: var(--gold); }
    .badge svg { width: 24px; height: 24px; fill: var(--gold); flex-shrink: 0; }
    .badge-text small { display: block; font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gray); }
    .badge-text span  { display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; }
    .hero-note { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--gray); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

    #about { padding: 120px 48px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-label { font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .section-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.8rem); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .section-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); }

    .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: start; }
    .about-text p { font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.9; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.75); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .about-text strong { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; }

    .about-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2px; }
    .stat { padding: 32px; background: var(--mid); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.08); transition: border-color 0.3s; }
    .stat:hover { border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.3); }
    .stat-number { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .stat-label  { font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gray); }

    .staff-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 2px; margin-top: 64px; }
    .staff-card { background: var(--mid); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.08); text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .staff-card::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 2px; background: var(--gold); transform: scaleX(0); transition: transform 0.3s; }
    .staff-card:hover::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
    .staff-card:hover { border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.25); }
    .staff-photo { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1/1; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; display: block; transition: filter 0.4s; }
    .staff-card:hover .staff-photo { filter: brightness(1.05); }
    .staff-info { padding: 24px 20px 28px; }
    .staff-name { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .staff-role { font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .staff-bio  { font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.6); }

    footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15); padding: 64px 48px 32px; }
    .footer-grid { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto 48px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .footer-logo { height: 60px; width: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .footer-tagline { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gray); letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.6; }
    .footer-col h4 { font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .footer-col p, .footer-col a { font-size: 0.8rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.6); line-height: 2; text-decoration: none; display: block; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .hours-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(245,240,232,0.6); padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
    .hours-row span:last-child { color: var(--gold-lt); }
    .hours-row.closed span:last-child { color: var(--gray); }
    .footer-bottom { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
    .footer-bottom p { font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--gray); letter-spacing: 0.05em; }

    @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
    .reveal { opacity:0; transform:translateY(30px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

    @media (max-width: 900px) { .staff-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); } }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav { padding: 0 20px; }
      #about { padding: 80px 24px; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
      .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .staff-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .store-badges { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="#home" class="nav-logo">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Art Deco Parrucchieri">
  </a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#about">About Us</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section id="home">
  <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Art Deco" class="hero-logo-img">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Bari &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Dal 1998 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Parrucchieri Uomo &amp; Donna</p>
  <div class="hero-divider"></div>
  <div class="app-section">
    <p class="qr-label">Scarica la nostra app</p>
    <div class="qr-wrapper">
  <a href="https://linktr.ee/artdeco_parrucchieri" target="_blank">
    <img src="art_deco.png" alt="QR Code App">
  </a>
  </div>
    <div class="store-badges">
      <a href="https://apps.apple.com/it/app/art-dec%C3%B2-parrucchieri/id6760341046" target="_blank" class="badge">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.8-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/></svg>
        <div class="badge-text"><small>Scarica su</small><span>App Store</span></div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.artdeco.parrucchieri" target="_blank" class="badge">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3.18 23.76c.3.17.64.22.98.14l.11-.06 10.5-10.5-2.1-2.1zM20.65 9.19l-2.88-1.64-2.36 2.36 2.36 2.36 2.9-1.65c.83-.47.83-1.76-.02-2.43zM2.12.25C1.8.55 1.62 1 1.62 1.6v20.8c0 .6.18 1.05.5 1.35l.07.06L13.13 12.7v-.26L2.19.19z"/></svg>
        <div class="badge-text"><small>Disponibile su</small><span>Google Play</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">Inquadra il QR code con la fotocamera per scaricare l'app</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <p class="section-label reveal">La nostra storia</p>
  <h2 class="section-title reveal">Dal <em>1998</em><br>con passione</h2>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-text reveal">
      <p><strong>Fabio Sblendorio</strong> nasce nel 1975 a Bari, fondatore degli Art Deco Parrucchieri. Alla tenera eta di 11 anni inizia a seguire il suo sogno di barbiere. Nel 1998 realizza il suo sogno aprendo il suo atelier nel cuore di Bari.</p>
      <p><strong>Francesca De Benedictis</strong>, responsabile reparto donna, porta con se anni di esperienza nei migliori saloni di Bari, unendo tecnica raffinata e sensibilita artistica in ogni creazione.</p>
      <p>Un team affiatato, un accoglienza calorosa, e la cura per ogni dettaglio: questi sono i valori che ci guidano da oltre 25 anni.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-stats reveal">
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-number">25+</div><div class="stat-label">Anni di esperienza</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-number">4</div><div class="stat-label">Stylist esperti</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-number">&#8734;</div><div class="stat-label">Clienti soddisfatti</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-number">1998</div><div class="stat-label">Anno di fondazione</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="staff-grid">
    <div class="staff-card reveal">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Fabio Sblendorio" class="staff-photo">
      <div class="staff-info">
        <div class="staff-name">Fabio Sblendorio</div>
        <div class="staff-role">Fondatore &middot; Stylist Uomo</div>
        <p class="staff-bio">Oltre 30 anni di passione per il capello. Punto di riferimento per lo stile maschile a Bari.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="staff-card reveal">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Francesca De Benedictis" class="staff-photo">
      <div class="staff-info">
        <div class="staff-name">Francesca De Benedictis</div>
        <div class="staff-role">Responsabile Donna</div>
        <p class="staff-bio">Tecnica raffinata e sensibilita artistica per ogni cliente del reparto donna.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="staff-card reveal">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Giuseppe Raspone" class="staff-photo">
      <div class="staff-info">
        <div class="staff-name">Giuseppe Raspone</div>
        <div class="staff-role">Stylist Uomo</div>
        <p class="staff-bio">16 anni di esperienza al fianco del fondatore. Esperto specialista del settore uomo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="staff-card reveal">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Viviana Poliseno" class="staff-photo">
      <div class="staff-info">
        <div class="staff-name">Viviana Poliseno</div>
        <div class="staff-role">Stylist Donna</div>
        <p class="staff-bio">Formata alla Nouvelle Esthetique Academie. Il jolly creativo del reparto donna.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-grid">
    <div>
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Art Deco" class="footer-logo">
      <p class="footer-tagline">Parrucchieri &middot; Uomo &middot; Donna<br>Bari &middot; Dal 1998</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Contatti</h4>
      <a href="https://goo.gl/maps/23neYChUwEtx1Xci6" target="_blank">Via Pasubio 41, 70121 Bari</a>
      <a href="tel:3478139987">347 813 9987</a>
      <a href="mailto:info@artdecoparrucchieri.it">info@artdecoparrucchieri.it</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Orari</h4>
      <div class="hours-row"><span>Mar - Gio</span><span>9:00-13:00, 16:00-20:00</span></div>
      <div class="hours-row"><span>Ven - Sab</span><span>9:00-19:00</span></div>
      <div class="hours-row closed"><span>Dom e Lun</span><span>Chiuso</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <p>2025 Art Deco Parrucchieri &middot; Via Pasubio 41, Bari</p>
    <p>info@artdecoparrucchieri.it &middot; 347 813 9987</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries) {
    entries.forEach(function(entry, i) {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        setTimeout(function() { entry.target.classList.add('visible'); }, i * 90);
        observer.unobserve(entry.target);
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.1 });
  reveals.forEach(function(el) { observer.observe(el); });
</script>

</body>
</html>
